The deterministic tests, typecheck, and build pass. Lint is blocked by pre-existing line-ending/formatting changes across the worktree, not by this commit. I found a concrete workflow hardening issue: public configuration values are interpolated directly into a shell script, so a quote or shell metacharacter in a configured value could alter the deploy command. I’m changing the deploy step to consume step environment variables instead and adding a contract assertion for that boundary.
